    "howToAdd": "Copy a category or a product object and fill it in. Order in the arrays = order on the page. 'slug' must be unique and is what the filter tab matches on.",
    "enabled": "Set \"enabled\": false on a category or a product to hide it without deleting it. That is the JSON equivalent of commenting the markup out.",
    "images": "A product without an \"image\" renders as a text-only card - the CSS already handles that case. Each brand keeps its pictures in images/products/<brand-label>/ - e.g. images/products/svr/. A new brand gets a new folder named after its label, lowercased and hyphenated. See images/README.md."
  },

